Giorgi (G-042): the plan card offered „ვადასტურებ", „შევცვალოთ" and „სხვა, მე
დავწერ" — the last two the same act, since „change it" lets the owner type. A
set that carries the server's own „change it" (any language) now gets no
„other". Every other set keeps it (Misho, 3 Oct).

